   "subject": "how to add samples name in ggplot2",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"margin-left:28.9px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(148,33,146)\">Hi,</p><p style=\"margin-left:28.9px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(148,33,146)\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-left:28.9px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(148,33,146)\">I want to add sample names based on metadata column in gglpot2 but it showing some error, could you please suggest how I can do this:</p><p style=\"margin-left:28.9px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(148,33,146)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:28.9px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(148,33,146)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">this code is working fine:</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">p=plot_ordination(physeq.rarefy, physeq.rarefy_bray, shape =&quot;Region&quot;, color = &quot;Villages&quot;)</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&gt; p = p + geom_point(size = 4, alpha = 0.75)</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&gt; p = p + scale_color_manual(values = allGroupsColors)</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">&gt; p + ggtitle(&quot;PCoA root 16S data, Bray distance&quot;)<br></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">I have tried to add sample name but it is showing some error:</p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">&gt; p + ggtitle(&quot;PCoA root 16S data, Bray distance&quot;)+geom_text(&quot;#SampleID&quot;)</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">\r\n</span></p><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><b>Error: `mapping` must be created by `aes()`</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><b><br></b></span></div><p style=\"font-stretch:normal;font-size:11px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">metadata column:</p><p style=\"margin-left:28.9px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(148,33,146)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:28.9px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(148,33,146)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">#SampleID<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Treatment<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Group<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Villages<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Region</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:28.9px;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(148,33,146)\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">leaf.10.S39<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>ash<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Leaf<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Matura<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Rajshahi</span></p><div><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">Thanks</span></div><div><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:no-common-ligatures\">Yogesh</span></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
