     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif\">You need to specify all coordinates in `geom_text()`. See examples for this geom: <a href=\"https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_text.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_text.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792366305642000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0CI_D0hqJU7l0E4VzjXbZO\">https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/geom_text.html</a></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif\">Cheers,</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,sans-serif\">Roman<br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
